=== LEAD SUMMARY OF PROBE OUTCOMES (2026-09-18, HEAD dff38a0) ===
P1 CONFIRMED: X-Van-Internal-Token alone mints a pairing ticket; /v1/devices/pair (no auth) then
  returns the ingress bearer AND a device access token; that device then calls owner APIs (200).
P2 CONFIRMED: CriticalReasoningKernel.assess persists a caller-authored record with a fabricated
  "sourced" fact, zero critic findings, zero verifier findings, confidence 0.99 -> is_actionable=True.
P3 CONFIRMED: three unverified free-form episode_ref strings drive an owner preference to CONFIRMED
  with owner_confirmed_at_ms=None; RelationshipCalibrationEngine then reports the reason as
  "owner-confirmed preference for terse updates".
P4 CONFIRMED (with nuance): a mission with no checkable postcondition is correctly refused
  (MISSION_SUCCESS_CONTRACT_NOT_CHECKABLE). But when the same caller supplies BOTH the success
  contract and the verification receipt, VERIFIED_SUCCESS is granted on a receipt whose
  verifier_version is "i-say-so/1.0" and whose only evidence_ref is "evidence://trust-me".
  No server-side verifier executes. The no-false-success invariant is a schema check, not a proof.
